WEBVTT

01:30.480 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

02:21.640 --> 02:23.320
Alright. The array is complete.

02:23.400 --> 02:24.960
It will take just ten breaths
to reach the Snow City.

02:25.040 --> 02:26.200
Let's enter the array.

02:28.320 --> 02:29.800
Don't forget what you promised me.

02:30.720 --> 02:32.320
I promise.

02:32.400 --> 02:34.440
Once we reach the Snow City,

02:34.520 --> 02:36.520
I won't cause any trouble for you.

02:36.600 --> 02:38.600
If I detect the scent of the Dark Clan,

02:38.680 --> 02:40.280
I'll tell you immediately.

03:22.080 --> 03:23.240
What's going on?

03:23.320 --> 03:24.960
Someone reversed the array,

03:25.040 --> 03:26.400
changing the teleportation
into a killing trap.

03:26.480 --> 03:27.680
Feng Yao, assist!

03:37.600 --> 03:39.760
Sir, the array is about to collapse.

04:02.880 --> 04:04.080
-Are you okay?
-Sir!

04:04.160 --> 04:05.560
-I'm fine.
-No problem.

04:07.160 --> 04:09.600
Fortunately, you've regained
60% of your spiritual power today.

04:09.680 --> 04:11.760
Otherwise, we would have died
in the array.

04:12.400 --> 04:14.360
There was no intrusion
into the Greenview Heights.

04:15.200 --> 04:16.519
How was this manipulated?

04:16.600 --> 04:19.040
It must be the materials for the array.

04:19.640 --> 04:21.440
The teleportation array materials
are already scarce.

04:21.519 --> 04:23.920
Some of them were got from outside.

04:24.000 --> 04:27.720
Someone must have planted a killing spell
in the materials in advance.

04:34.440 --> 04:36.440
It's… It's all my fault.

04:37.920 --> 04:42.040
I didn't detect
the killing spell's aura in time.

04:42.640 --> 04:43.720
It's not your fault.

04:44.400 --> 04:45.680
The killing spell
was hidden from the start.

04:45.760 --> 04:46.840
It's hard to detect.

04:46.920 --> 04:49.480
Plus, the array
requires refining the materials,

04:49.560 --> 04:51.800
making it even more hidden

04:51.880 --> 04:53.960
and harder to detect.

04:57.480 --> 04:58.320
You're still so young.

04:58.920 --> 05:00.880
If you could detect a killing spell,

05:00.960 --> 05:03.080
you wouldn't need to absorb
treasure energy for training.

05:03.680 --> 05:04.560
We're all here.

05:04.640 --> 05:06.160
You don't need to blame yourself.

05:09.080 --> 05:10.120
This whole thing

05:11.080 --> 05:13.480
was part of Sang Qi
and the Decaying Immortal Pavilion's plan.

05:14.640 --> 05:16.120
Perhaps from the Mirage Palace onward,

05:16.200 --> 05:18.080
it was a two-birds-with-one-stone trap.

05:18.680 --> 05:21.640
You mean, when something
happened at the Mirage Palace,

05:22.280 --> 05:23.600
one goal was to steal the jade token,

05:23.680 --> 05:25.160
the other was to mislead us

05:26.080 --> 05:29.280
to give them a chance
to mess with the teleportation array?

05:30.280 --> 05:32.160
You're the most skilled in arrays.

05:32.240 --> 05:33.280
If you'd been here,

05:33.360 --> 05:34.560
you'd have easily noticed
the problem with the materials.

05:35.400 --> 05:38.400
So, they created a huge distraction,
luring you away as well.

05:38.480 --> 05:39.800
True.

05:39.880 --> 05:43.320
Mr. Nan's research
on the teleportation array was no secret.

05:43.880 --> 05:47.440
After you came out of the Dark Abyss,
you didn't go straight to the Snow City,

05:47.520 --> 05:49.440
but chose to come here,
to Greenview Heights.

05:50.040 --> 05:51.440
They must have guessed

05:51.520 --> 05:53.080
that your spiritual power
wasn't fully restored

05:53.160 --> 05:55.320
and wanted to use the teleportation array
to go back to the Snow City.

05:56.240 --> 05:58.040
It's all so cleverly connected,

05:58.560 --> 06:00.320
a deadly trap.

06:00.840 --> 06:03.960
Right now, I'm more concerned about
the situation in the Snow City.

06:04.560 --> 06:06.080
I don't know how they will strike.

06:08.000 --> 06:09.400
The paper crane was sent a few days ago.

06:10.000 --> 06:12.080
Leader Xie must have received
the message by now.

06:12.160 --> 06:13.720
You don't need to worry too much.

06:14.240 --> 06:15.920
Since the materials are destroyed now,

06:16.000 --> 06:18.400
how long will it take
to gather them again?

06:18.480 --> 06:19.520
Well…

06:20.600 --> 06:22.000
It might take another ten days.

06:22.600 --> 06:25.080
Is there any other way
to quickly return to the Snow City?

06:28.120 --> 06:29.280
Actually,

06:30.600 --> 06:31.840
there is something might help.

06:36.520 --> 06:37.360
The Cloud Floating Airship?

06:37.440 --> 06:38.840
That's right.

06:38.920 --> 06:40.600
It belonged to Fu Lansheng, the former
young master of the Jade Sky Palace.

06:40.680 --> 06:42.240
He lost it to me in a bet long ago.

06:43.000 --> 06:44.600
I haven't used it in many years.

06:47.880 --> 06:50.440
The teleportation array
takes just ten breaths to reach,

06:51.080 --> 06:52.480
but this one will take a bit longer.

06:52.560 --> 06:53.760
That's why I didn't consider it at first.

06:54.360 --> 06:55.920
But given the current situation,

06:56.000 --> 06:59.200
it's better than flying
on a sword or riding a horse.

07:04.080 --> 07:06.760
It's just a small boat.
How are we supposed to fit people on it?

07:08.120 --> 07:09.800
A boat needs water to sail.

07:18.760 --> 07:19.920
We can head out now.

07:21.600 --> 07:22.800
How do we?

07:42.480 --> 07:44.280
The Jade Sky Palace is truly wealthy.

07:45.880 --> 07:47.240
What about the Snow City's finances?

07:48.200 --> 07:49.720
You pulled me out of the Dark Abyss,

07:49.800 --> 07:51.840
and I didn't bring any money with me.

07:52.480 --> 07:54.800
As a disciple of the Snow City,
is there an allowance?

07:59.600 --> 08:00.800
Let me give you some advice.

08:01.320 --> 08:02.320
When you get to the Snow City,

08:02.400 --> 08:04.320
it's better to listen more and talk less.

08:04.880 --> 08:06.760
If you get into trouble and anger someone,

08:07.280 --> 08:08.120
I won't help you.

08:09.160 --> 08:11.080
You're saying this now,

08:11.160 --> 08:12.680
but during the crisis earlier,

08:12.760 --> 08:16.320
who was it
splitting his shield to protect me

08:16.400 --> 08:18.520
with only 60%
of his spiritual power recovered?

08:19.440 --> 08:20.960
Xie Xuechen,

08:22.080 --> 08:23.560
just admit it.

08:24.320 --> 08:26.000
You can't bear to see me die.

08:26.080 --> 08:29.200
Not wanting you to die
and not letting you die

08:29.280 --> 08:30.440
are two completely different things.

08:31.840 --> 08:32.679
You're just stubborn.

08:36.159 --> 08:37.320
Xuyue,

08:39.200 --> 08:41.880
this crisis
is much more serious than I expected.

08:42.559 --> 08:45.600
You are not from the Immortal Alliance,
so you don't need to take further risks.

08:46.120 --> 08:47.160
Don't go to the Snow City.

08:48.120 --> 08:50.440
It's too late to say that now.

08:54.560 --> 08:56.280
Sang Qi and the Decaying Immortal Pavilion

08:57.080 --> 08:59.400
joined forces against my Greenview Heights

08:59.480 --> 09:00.840
and ruined my precious materials.

09:00.920 --> 09:04.440
I'll definitely get back at them for this.

09:04.960 --> 09:06.840
Otherwise, how can
Greenview Heights survive?

09:06.920 --> 09:09.240
-Xuyue!
-I have a plan.

09:16.080 --> 09:17.680
Since we've come this far together,

09:18.960 --> 09:20.600
let's continue this journey together.

09:24.360 --> 09:25.200
Miss Mu,

09:26.040 --> 09:27.080
do you mind?

09:28.560 --> 09:30.200
The more friends, the more support.

09:30.280 --> 09:32.440
With you joining us,
I couldn't be more delighted.

09:33.360 --> 09:34.560
That's good.

09:35.280 --> 09:36.440
Feng Yao,

09:37.120 --> 09:38.080
guard here well.

09:38.160 --> 09:39.120
If anything happens,
contact with the paper crane.

09:39.720 --> 09:40.760
Understood.

09:41.480 --> 09:42.520
It's getting late.

09:43.720 --> 09:44.840
Let's head out.

10:08.920 --> 10:10.800
Bao, stop being so upset.

10:10.880 --> 10:11.920
Come out.

10:13.280 --> 10:17.480
If father finds out
I'm such a useless sniffer,

10:17.560 --> 10:20.240
will he abandon me?

10:20.320 --> 10:23.320
Fine, you've never even met your father.

10:23.400 --> 10:24.920
How could you have such deep feelings?

10:25.000 --> 10:28.480
A father is a father,
even if I've never met him.

10:30.560 --> 10:32.480
If you've never met your parents,

10:33.080 --> 10:34.680
do they count as parents?

10:34.760 --> 10:36.920
Of course, they do! Mother said Father…

10:40.920 --> 10:42.280
Ah…

10:42.360 --> 10:44.480
Are we… in the sky?

10:45.120 --> 10:47.600
We're on our way to Mr. Xie's home.

10:47.680 --> 10:49.320
Don't be scared. Take a look around.

10:49.400 --> 10:50.320
Isn't the moonlight beautiful?

10:50.400 --> 10:51.680
I…

10:51.760 --> 10:54.680
I'll wait until we land,
then I'll come out.

11:00.080 --> 11:03.040
With your little courage,
you still want to follow me?

11:03.600 --> 11:06.160
Yes, I want to learn some skills.

11:06.240 --> 11:07.200
Miss Mu.

11:15.560 --> 11:17.400
Mr. Nan, you're here
to enjoy the view too?

11:18.200 --> 11:20.000
I must congratulate you, Miss Mu.

11:20.080 --> 11:20.920
You've gotten what you wished for.

11:21.960 --> 11:23.000
Thank you.

11:23.680 --> 11:25.640
I've never been to the Snow City.

11:26.680 --> 11:27.880
It should be quite interesting.

11:29.040 --> 11:32.160
I would say, because of your arrival,

11:32.240 --> 11:34.440
the Snow City
will become very interesting.

11:35.400 --> 11:36.920
So,

11:37.000 --> 11:38.720
you also find Xie Xuechen boring, right?

11:42.640 --> 11:44.400
You actually know.

11:45.000 --> 11:46.680
It's not that he wants to be boring.

11:52.000 --> 11:55.520
Those born with the extra sense
carry a lot on their shoulders.

11:56.520 --> 11:57.680
They are expected to achieve much.

11:58.280 --> 11:59.880
They are bound by many things.

12:01.720 --> 12:03.920
Sometimes, they can't even tell

12:04.000 --> 12:07.200
whether what the world admires
is truly the person themselves

12:08.200 --> 12:10.160
or merely the power they hold

12:10.840 --> 12:12.720
to protect the world.

12:17.320 --> 12:19.240
Mr. Nan, are you talking
about Xie Xuechen,

12:19.840 --> 12:21.400
or are you talking about yourself?

12:22.480 --> 12:24.160
After all, you used to be someone

12:24.760 --> 12:26.440
born with the extra sense.

12:31.520 --> 12:32.800
Miss Mu, you're truly insightful.

12:33.520 --> 12:36.640
But as you just said,
that was in the past.

12:40.720 --> 12:42.680
Now, I've lost my three senses.

12:43.440 --> 12:45.280
At most, I'm just…

12:45.840 --> 12:47.680
an ordinary person who can draw symbols.

12:49.920 --> 12:52.440
As the head of the Greenview Heights,

12:52.520 --> 12:54.840
the top array master of our time

12:54.920 --> 12:56.400
and exceptionally intelligent,

12:57.200 --> 12:58.800
if you consider yourself
just an ordinary person,

12:59.440 --> 13:02.680
then what are those truly ordinary people
supposed to think of themselves?

13:02.760 --> 13:05.560
Alright. I misspoke.

13:05.640 --> 13:09.120
I'm just a straightforward person.
Please forgive me.

13:10.480 --> 13:12.280
I just think

13:12.360 --> 13:15.120
someone who can carve a new path
out of a deadlock

13:15.200 --> 13:17.160
and rise again to the peak

13:17.840 --> 13:20.560
doesn't need
such cheap comfort or sympathy.

13:21.280 --> 13:22.320
I don't want

13:22.840 --> 13:25.600
nor do I have the right
to show any self-righteous kindness.

13:27.320 --> 13:30.280
That kind of pity
is a sign of looking down on you.

13:31.160 --> 13:32.480
I think you wouldn't agree

13:33.440 --> 13:34.680
and would definitely not be happy.

13:39.720 --> 13:42.400
Though you're from the Spirit Clan,

13:43.520 --> 13:45.160
you see through people very clearly.

13:46.680 --> 13:47.600
Likewise.

14:04.200 --> 14:05.680
You're here to enjoy the view too?

14:06.960 --> 14:07.920
Xuechen!

14:11.640 --> 14:12.640
I'm here just getting some fresh air.

14:14.240 --> 14:15.920
You're so unromantic.

14:16.000 --> 14:18.840
In this regard,
you should learn from Mr. Nan more.

14:26.520 --> 14:29.360
Once we reach the Snow City,
if you speak like this again,

14:30.040 --> 14:32.280
I'm afraid you'll be expelled
in a few days.

14:39.400 --> 14:40.240
We haven't even arrived yet.

14:40.920 --> 14:41.800
Besides,

14:41.880 --> 14:44.320
I only say this kind of thing to you.

14:46.720 --> 14:47.920
Fine.

14:48.000 --> 14:49.320
Forget what I said.

14:51.640 --> 14:53.120
What did you promise me?

14:55.600 --> 14:56.600
Control myself.

14:58.320 --> 14:59.320
I got it.

15:08.160 --> 15:09.880
My mood is so bad,

15:09.960 --> 15:11.640
even the moonlight isn't as beautiful now.

15:12.360 --> 15:13.360
You guys talk.

15:22.480 --> 15:26.520
Miss Mu really says
whatever she thinks to you.

15:28.920 --> 15:30.800
That's not always a good thing.

15:31.400 --> 15:32.400
Isn't that fine?

15:33.520 --> 15:36.480
Didn't you want to see through her
from the start?

15:39.080 --> 15:40.440
I have one more thing to ask you.

15:41.800 --> 15:42.720
What is it?

15:43.320 --> 15:47.000
Why did you agree to take Miss Mu
back to the Snow City?

15:58.440 --> 16:00.760
The war between humans
and spirits lasted for so long.

16:02.480 --> 16:05.320
Since I was young,
I've witnessed countless lives suffer.

16:06.040 --> 16:07.840
Now, the war has ended,

16:07.920 --> 16:11.000
but the scars have never healed.

16:12.600 --> 16:15.640
To this day, the humans
still enslave the spirits,

16:16.520 --> 16:18.960
and the conflict
between them has only deepened.

16:19.040 --> 16:21.080
Hatred is like burning hot oil,

16:22.120 --> 16:25.200
requiring countless bloodshed
to extinguish.

16:26.400 --> 16:28.200
It's time to actively
embrace the Spirit Clan.

16:28.960 --> 16:31.080
It starts with
allowing them into the sect.

16:31.160 --> 16:32.600
And Miss Mu

16:33.680 --> 16:34.920
is the first.

16:36.040 --> 16:37.320
That's all?

16:39.400 --> 16:40.480
Otherwise?

16:44.240 --> 16:45.400
Then, let it be,

16:46.640 --> 16:50.040
human-spirit coexistence
and a world of harmony.

16:51.520 --> 16:54.280
I wish you will get what you wish for.

17:07.920 --> 17:12.000
TWO DAYS LATER

17:14.200 --> 17:15.640
So, this is the Snow City.

17:16.920 --> 17:20.000
It doesn't look like much
of an interesting place.

17:23.280 --> 17:24.119
Interesting?

17:28.680 --> 17:31.120
Once we reach the Snow City,
you will be an external disciple.

17:31.200 --> 17:32.880
Everything must be done
according to the rules.

17:33.480 --> 17:35.520
The Snow City has strict rules.

17:36.240 --> 17:38.040
No disciple will be tolerated
for breaking the rules,

17:38.120 --> 17:39.760
not even me.

17:40.280 --> 17:41.440
Of course,

17:42.360 --> 17:45.280
I've always followed the rules
and been the most obedient.

17:45.360 --> 17:46.640
You know that.

17:47.360 --> 17:50.360
The Snow City is very different
from the Mirage Palace.

17:51.160 --> 17:53.880
Miss Mu, you will soon realize this.

17:53.960 --> 17:55.440
What's the difference?

17:55.520 --> 17:57.280
The five sects of the Immortal Alliance
all handle matters differently.

17:57.960 --> 17:59.560
The Mirage Palace is vibrant

17:59.640 --> 18:01.160
but harsh and ruthless
towards the Spirit Clan.

18:01.240 --> 18:02.720
As for the Snow City,

18:02.800 --> 18:05.840
as you can see, snow-covered,

18:05.920 --> 18:08.240
towering above the cold, steep cliffs,

18:08.320 --> 18:09.720
pure and spotless,

18:09.800 --> 18:11.520
leaving no room for any impurity.

18:13.240 --> 18:14.480
Indeed,

18:14.560 --> 18:17.680
the Lord of the Snow City
is a decisive and ruthless leader,

18:17.760 --> 18:19.360
a man of unwavering fairness.

18:19.440 --> 18:20.800
But it's okay.

18:21.320 --> 18:23.160
If he's harsh with me,

18:23.840 --> 18:26.280
I believe Mr. Xie
will definitely protect me.

18:26.880 --> 18:27.840
Right?

18:42.240 --> 18:46.680
SNOW CITY

19:10.280 --> 19:12.680
Welcome, Young Lord!

19:14.440 --> 19:15.400
Young Lord.

19:15.480 --> 19:16.320
ELDER CANG

19:18.720 --> 19:21.640
Elders, it's good to see you.

19:22.280 --> 19:23.440
Mr. Nan,

19:23.520 --> 19:25.720
It's been many years.
Your elegance surpasses the past.

19:26.320 --> 19:27.720
Elder Cang, you're joking.

19:29.360 --> 19:31.520
Young Lord, who is she?

19:37.160 --> 19:38.920
This is Mu Xuanling.

19:39.000 --> 19:41.480
Starting today, she will be
a disciple of the Snow City.

19:44.840 --> 19:46.520
Naturally, she will begin
as an external disciple.

19:46.600 --> 19:49.560
New disciples are managed
by you, Elder Cang.

19:50.840 --> 19:52.040
`Elder Cang?

19:52.120 --> 19:53.160
Should't I learn from you?

19:54.840 --> 19:55.680
Young Lord,

19:56.400 --> 19:58.280
this is very sudden. She…

19:58.360 --> 19:59.400
We will discuss her matter later.

19:59.480 --> 20:00.800
I must see
the Alliance Leader immediately.

20:00.880 --> 20:02.800
The Alliance Leader
will leave seclusion tonight.

20:02.880 --> 20:05.040
Please take a rest for now.

20:05.120 --> 20:06.240
The Alliance Leader is still in seclusion?

20:06.320 --> 20:07.200
Yes.

20:07.280 --> 20:10.400
Since you left,
the Alliance Leader hasn't left seclusion.

20:11.040 --> 20:12.520
You've exceeded your return deadline.

20:13.040 --> 20:14.480
We've been very worried.

20:14.560 --> 20:15.440
We wanted to report to the Alliance Leader

20:15.520 --> 20:16.640
and headed
to the Two Realms Mountain to find you,

20:16.720 --> 20:18.440
but alas, he was in meditation.

20:18.520 --> 20:21.120
We feared disturbing him
at a crucial moment,

20:21.200 --> 20:22.520
worried he might fall into madness.

20:22.600 --> 20:23.840
So, we had no choice but to wait.

20:25.560 --> 20:27.440
I sent him a message via paper crane.

20:27.520 --> 20:29.680
Was there no response or arrangements?

20:30.920 --> 20:32.080
A message?

20:33.800 --> 20:36.680
No. Did the message mention anything?

20:38.280 --> 20:41.440
YONGQIAN PAVILION

20:47.920 --> 20:50.640
Sir, I, Xie Xuechen, request an audience.

20:56.200 --> 20:58.360
Blood! I detect the smell of blood!

21:19.720 --> 21:20.680
Sir!

22:27.120 --> 22:28.120
The Alliance Leader…

22:29.640 --> 22:30.480
passed away.

22:33.880 --> 22:34.800
The Alliance Leader…

22:36.840 --> 22:38.160
passed away.

22:38.240 --> 22:39.080
Sir…

22:43.360 --> 22:44.760
This is impossible.

22:45.600 --> 22:46.560
How could this happen?

22:48.040 --> 22:49.400
This is Snow City,

22:50.080 --> 22:51.720
our own place.

22:52.400 --> 22:53.560
How could this happen?

22:53.640 --> 22:55.040
With the Leader's Spiritual Form stage

22:55.120 --> 22:57.280
and disciples patrolling
outside the Yongqian Pavilion,

22:57.360 --> 22:59.640
how could he have been assassinated
without anyone noticing?

23:00.280 --> 23:01.880
Who could have done this?

23:01.960 --> 23:03.840
It's our failure to protect
the Alliance Leader.

23:03.920 --> 23:05.160
It's all my fault.

23:06.520 --> 23:08.600
Why didn't I go in
to check on him earlier?

23:09.320 --> 23:10.280
Investigate!

23:10.880 --> 23:12.920
We must find out who the murderer is!

23:17.800 --> 23:20.560
Sir, Sang Qi collaborated with
a traitor from the Immortal Alliance,

23:20.640 --> 23:21.920
attempting to seize the Chaos Pearl.

23:22.000 --> 23:23.400
Be careful.

23:23.480 --> 23:25.000
I will return soon.

23:29.960 --> 23:30.880
Elders,

23:33.280 --> 23:34.600
the death of the Alliance Leader

23:36.120 --> 23:38.160
brings great sorrow to the Snow City.

23:39.080 --> 23:42.520
However, you are the pillars of our sect.

23:43.200 --> 23:44.400
You must not collapse.

23:45.280 --> 23:46.640
This is not the time for self-blame,

23:47.680 --> 23:48.880
nor for despair.

23:49.600 --> 23:50.680
Please, Elders,

23:51.560 --> 23:53.000
lock down the Snow City

23:54.160 --> 23:55.440
and send word of the loss.

23:57.080 --> 23:58.400
For the rest of the matters,

24:00.360 --> 24:03.000
-I will make arrangements.
-Understood.

24:10.760 --> 24:12.320
This paper crane hasn't been opened,

24:13.080 --> 24:14.400
but it's stained with blood.

24:15.400 --> 24:16.560
It seems the Leader

24:16.640 --> 24:19.400
was murdered shortly
before the paper crane arrived.

24:54.200 --> 24:56.320
The killer came
for the Sect Leader's jade token.

24:59.480 --> 25:01.560
It… it is a fake.

25:49.360 --> 25:50.240
Sword cultivators

25:50.320 --> 25:53.920
must never abandon their sword.

26:04.280 --> 26:05.400
You did it.

26:14.000 --> 26:15.240
Yan Tong.

26:15.320 --> 26:16.280
Here.

26:16.840 --> 26:18.120
Guard the Alliance Leader's body.

26:18.880 --> 26:19.760
Understood.

26:21.040 --> 26:22.560
Where are you going?

26:23.520 --> 26:25.360
He's going to check on the Chaos Pearl.

26:26.880 --> 26:28.880
It seems the matter with the Mirage Palace

26:28.960 --> 26:30.200
wasn't a two-birds-with-one-stone
situation,

26:31.800 --> 26:33.400
but a three-birds-with-one-stone.

26:38.600 --> 26:39.440
The enemy's target…

26:39.520 --> 26:40.360
PEARL TOWER

26:40.440 --> 26:41.920
…is not just the Mirage Palace,

26:42.000 --> 26:44.080
not just killing Xie Xuechen,

26:44.600 --> 26:46.040
but also the Snow City.

26:46.760 --> 26:49.000
They set up a killing spell
in the teleportation array,

26:49.080 --> 26:51.120
aiming to destroy the array,

26:51.200 --> 26:53.280
delaying Xuechen's return to the city,

26:53.360 --> 26:54.720
so they could

26:56.160 --> 26:57.320
kill the Alliance Leader

26:59.000 --> 27:00.080
and seize the jade token.

27:01.320 --> 27:04.880
Their ultimate goal is the Chaos Pearl.

27:34.440 --> 27:36.760
He saved the Mirage City,

27:36.840 --> 27:38.600
but failed to save his own father.

27:39.640 --> 27:41.240
How guilty must he feel?

27:42.400 --> 27:43.520
This is an unsolvable trap.

28:07.080 --> 28:08.880
Since returning to the Snow City,

28:10.040 --> 28:12.120
he hasn't had a moment of rest.

28:12.200 --> 28:14.400
He keeps distracting himself
with various matters.

28:15.480 --> 28:16.680
If this continues,

28:17.840 --> 28:18.680
he will collapse.

28:19.560 --> 28:22.040
He knows the Alliance Leader's
expectations.

28:24.160 --> 28:25.160
The Chaos Pearl,

28:26.480 --> 28:27.680
the Snow City,

28:28.400 --> 28:29.480
humanity,

28:30.280 --> 28:31.400
and all beings.

28:32.560 --> 28:35.240
All of them come before
the sorrow of losing his father.

28:37.680 --> 28:38.800
He can only act like this.

28:39.480 --> 28:41.120
But has he ever thought of himself?

28:43.160 --> 28:44.240
Mr. Nan,

28:45.000 --> 28:46.400
you've known him for many years.

28:47.160 --> 28:48.280
Has he always been like this?

28:49.480 --> 28:50.720
Well,

28:52.200 --> 28:54.000
that was a long time ago.

28:54.680 --> 28:56.640
Because we were both born
with the extra sense,

28:57.200 --> 28:59.600
I was always compared to him.

28:59.680 --> 29:03.640
But for a long time, we never met.

29:04.960 --> 29:05.880
Until one time,

29:06.640 --> 29:08.640
a crack appeared in the Immortals Array,

29:09.240 --> 29:11.200
and many from the Dark Clan
were running wild,

29:12.040 --> 29:13.320
causing chaos in the human realm.

29:14.040 --> 29:15.560
Xie Xuechen and I

29:15.640 --> 29:18.480
were both sent to the Two Realms Mountain
to block the Dark Clan.

29:20.240 --> 29:22.280
That was our first meeting.

29:23.600 --> 29:25.040
Back then,

29:25.120 --> 29:27.520
he was very different from now.

29:29.080 --> 29:33.520
Kill!

30:17.600 --> 30:18.720
Foolish!

30:18.800 --> 30:20.840
The Dark Clan members
will revive time and time again.

30:20.920 --> 30:23.960
What you're doing now is meaningless!

30:24.800 --> 30:26.960
Then we will kill faster than they revive.
Isn't that enough?

30:42.680 --> 30:43.920
Be careful!

30:49.360 --> 30:50.280
I've predicted it before.

30:52.640 --> 30:54.080
So, you're the one
who can predict the future.

30:55.000 --> 30:56.320
Why don't we have a little competition?

31:00.360 --> 31:01.480
I'm ahead by one point.

31:12.760 --> 31:14.040
I scored one more point than you.

31:20.480 --> 31:22.080
How about it? Can you handle it?

31:22.800 --> 31:23.680
No problem.

31:23.760 --> 31:26.160
I knew I wouldn't die here.

31:29.920 --> 31:31.040
I've often heard of you.

31:31.560 --> 31:33.280
Are you interested
in visiting the Snow City?

31:35.000 --> 31:39.000
So, Xie Xuechen also has moments
where he's quite competitive?

31:39.840 --> 31:42.320
His father has always
been strict with him,

31:42.400 --> 31:44.320
but back then,
he was full of youthful pride,

31:45.120 --> 31:46.360
always rebellious.

31:47.080 --> 31:50.920
He always thought
he should live his life his own way.

31:51.000 --> 31:54.720
I, too, thought
he could live life so freely.

31:57.800 --> 31:59.800
But then, ten years ago,

31:59.880 --> 32:01.680
he suddenly went to the Moonlight Heights

32:02.320 --> 32:04.400
and suddenly entered seclusion
at the Snow Cliff.

32:05.320 --> 32:06.560
When we met again,

32:07.720 --> 32:10.600
his character had changed drastically.

32:11.280 --> 32:12.440
Or rather,

32:14.240 --> 32:15.600
he became a completely different person.

32:18.120 --> 32:19.280
He became cold,

32:20.400 --> 32:22.880
restrained, and distant.

32:24.960 --> 32:27.160
I don't know what exactly happened to him,

32:28.560 --> 32:31.480
but he became the person

32:31.560 --> 32:33.640
his father always hoped he would be.

33:10.240 --> 33:13.440
HALF A MONTH AGO

33:46.360 --> 33:47.920
It's been ten years.

33:49.480 --> 33:51.360
You've improved a lot.

33:53.120 --> 33:54.360
You've become stronger than me.

33:55.240 --> 33:56.080
Sir.

34:09.920 --> 34:11.880
The Immortals Array is incomplete now.

34:13.040 --> 34:14.360
You should go and fix it.

34:15.080 --> 34:15.920
Understood.

34:20.120 --> 34:21.560
When you return…

34:28.040 --> 34:29.840
Well, let's talk when you return.

34:39.600 --> 34:41.000
Cultivators must not have emotions.

34:41.080 --> 34:42.480
They must dedicate
themselves to their faith!

34:42.560 --> 34:44.440
Did you forget?

34:44.520 --> 34:47.320
Is your faith rooted in saving lives

34:47.400 --> 34:49.400
and caring for all beings?

34:49.920 --> 34:51.360
If so,

34:51.440 --> 34:53.199
then you must sever all emotions.

34:53.719 --> 34:55.520
If you have private favorites,

34:56.040 --> 34:58.040
how can you embrace all beings
with great love?

34:58.680 --> 35:01.280
You shouldn't favor any person

35:01.880 --> 35:03.080
or anything,

35:03.920 --> 35:04.920
not even yourself.

35:09.720 --> 35:11.040
When you return…

35:13.720 --> 35:14.840
Well, let's talk when you return.

35:37.200 --> 35:38.560
In the dead of night,

35:38.640 --> 35:40.360
you're practicing swordplay
here at the Snow Cliff.

35:41.400 --> 35:42.800
Aren't you afraid
of causing a snow collapse

35:42.880 --> 35:44.440
and burying the whole Snow City?

35:44.520 --> 35:46.240
What are you doing here? Leave here.

35:49.600 --> 35:50.720
You're upset,

35:51.440 --> 35:53.560
and now my bracelet is flashing with it.

35:53.640 --> 35:55.720
-How can I sleep?
-I told you to leave here!

35:58.400 --> 35:59.560
Xie Xuechen,

36:00.200 --> 36:03.520
there's no shame
in showing weakness to others.

36:03.600 --> 36:06.000
If you want to see,
I can cry for you right now.

36:07.120 --> 36:08.080
Leave here.

36:10.280 --> 36:11.720
I don't need your comfort.

36:11.800 --> 36:13.280
Xie Xuechen,

36:14.520 --> 36:16.040
why do you suppress yourself so much?

36:17.400 --> 36:21.000
Is it because your father said
cultivators can't have emotions?

36:27.720 --> 36:29.360
Back when we were trapped
in Desire Demon's cage,

36:30.800 --> 36:32.160
I saw you as a child.

36:33.160 --> 36:34.480
Your father believed

36:35.600 --> 36:38.120
that being heartless
was the only way to avoid having favorites

36:38.720 --> 36:40.240
and to achieve great love.

36:40.840 --> 36:42.720
I can't say he was wrong,

36:42.800 --> 36:45.840
but I believe
the path of faith may be heartless,

36:45.920 --> 36:47.360
but cultivators should value emotions.

36:48.520 --> 36:51.920
If a person
doesn't even understand small love,

36:52.000 --> 36:54.480
if their heart is left with
only desolation and indifference,

36:54.560 --> 36:57.960
how can they understand the true meaning
of all things in the world,

36:58.040 --> 37:00.160
and how can they truly love all beings?

37:02.440 --> 37:04.320
Just because you were born
with the extra sense,

37:04.400 --> 37:06.080
rare since ancient times,

37:06.600 --> 37:09.360
your father saw this as your destiny.

37:10.720 --> 37:11.960
But, Xie Xuechen,

37:12.760 --> 37:14.760
actually, no one can define your future.

37:17.040 --> 37:19.920
Humans are born with emotions and desires.

37:20.000 --> 37:21.560
They must exist for a reason.

37:22.800 --> 37:25.640
I am from the Spirit Clan,
and even I have emotions.

37:26.200 --> 37:28.600
You are human. How couldn't you have them?

37:29.760 --> 37:30.920
If you have emotions,

37:31.000 --> 37:33.840
you must release them, express them.

37:34.720 --> 37:37.120
Suppressing them deep inside
will cause problems.

37:38.280 --> 37:39.400
Xie Xuechen,

37:43.120 --> 37:46.120
you are just like everyone else,
flesh and blood.

37:47.320 --> 37:49.080
You've already done enough.

37:49.160 --> 37:50.480
Enough?

37:52.840 --> 37:54.960
I used to refuse to listen to his words.

37:55.040 --> 37:56.360
I was very rebellious.

37:57.080 --> 37:59.640
And in the end, I made a huge mistake
that I can never undo.

38:01.520 --> 38:02.760
Now,

38:04.560 --> 38:06.960
I thought I had let go
of emotions and love,

38:07.560 --> 38:08.760
but it turns out

38:10.080 --> 38:12.080
his expectations were something
I could never fulfill.

38:13.640 --> 38:15.280
On the day I said goodbye to him here,

38:16.760 --> 38:18.880
I really wanted to call him father,

38:19.680 --> 38:21.480
but in the end, I didn't have the courage.

38:24.400 --> 38:28.400
I am this hesitant, this timid.

38:30.520 --> 38:32.040
I will never hear

38:33.640 --> 38:35.200
the words he wanted to say.

38:52.320 --> 38:54.000
If the Alliance Leader were still here,

38:54.720 --> 38:56.960
he would want to say this to you,

38:58.000 --> 38:59.080
"Xuechen,

38:59.680 --> 39:00.840
all these years,

39:01.600 --> 39:03.760
I have been very strict with you.

39:04.520 --> 39:08.160
But actually, I always knew
how difficult it was for you."

39:13.800 --> 39:15.640
From the day you were born,

39:17.520 --> 39:21.360
I bound you with the responsibility
of the world's fate.

39:27.040 --> 39:28.920
To force you to sever all emotions,

39:30.480 --> 39:32.640
I even destroyed what you loved,

39:33.240 --> 39:34.960
clipped your wings,

39:35.760 --> 39:39.440
and imprisoned you in this small cage.

39:41.400 --> 39:43.000
And all of this

39:44.080 --> 39:48.200
was just to prepare you for the challenges

39:48.280 --> 39:51.200
you might face one day.

39:55.200 --> 39:57.400
I often wondered

39:59.360 --> 40:03.520
if I worried too much,

40:05.960 --> 40:09.080
if severing emotions
was truly the only way.

40:10.120 --> 40:12.040
Without my pressure,

40:14.480 --> 40:18.000
you could have lived
freely and brilliantly,

40:18.920 --> 40:21.160
soaring under an open sky.

40:23.040 --> 40:24.000
Father…

40:28.160 --> 40:29.800
Severing emotions and love

40:31.440 --> 40:32.960
is easy to say,

40:34.880 --> 40:37.920
but how many in this world
can truly achieve it?

40:45.480 --> 40:49.240
If even I cannot achieve it myself,

40:50.960 --> 40:52.240
should I

40:55.320 --> 40:56.800
have forced it upon you?

41:00.720 --> 41:02.160
Xuechen,

41:03.480 --> 41:05.000
I'm getting old.

41:07.040 --> 41:08.920
There will be an end someday.

41:11.080 --> 41:13.280
One day, I will leave.

41:16.160 --> 41:20.560
Maybe my way has grown outdated as well.

41:22.000 --> 41:25.120
The future belongs to your generation.

41:27.240 --> 41:29.320
Go walk your own path.

41:31.560 --> 41:33.240
I believe in you.

41:34.600 --> 41:38.200
You will shoulder the responsibility
in your own way

41:39.120 --> 41:41.920
and protect everything
you need to protect.

41:48.360 --> 41:49.520
Xuechen,

41:52.800 --> 41:54.120
actually,

41:55.640 --> 41:57.400
I'm also very timid.

41:58.800 --> 42:00.080
There's something

42:02.520 --> 42:04.080
I've always wanted to tell you.

42:16.360 --> 42:17.480
I…

42:19.200 --> 42:20.760
love you…

42:21.640 --> 42:22.760
I love you deeply.
